00:02:11.875 --> 00:02:12.932
Oh!


00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:15.942
Yeah, that's funny.


00:02:17.213 --> 00:02:18.577
Get out of the fucking road!


00:02:18.647 --> 00:02:21.241
Hey, learn how to drive, you fucking prick!


00:02:21.316 --> 00:02:22.577
Fuck you!


00:02:25.621 --> 00:02:30.148
Hey. Hey! Forgetting something?


00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:46.632
Okay, Rick, I really have to go.


00:02:47.641 --> 00:02:50.109
