- Rick...


00:02:51.211 --> 00:02:55.046
Look at me, I'm exhausted. I just...
I have to go home, okay?


00:02:55.116 --> 00:02:57.106
I'll call you. I promise.


00:02:59.351 --> 00:03:02.048
- Sure you're good to drive?
- Yeah.


00:03:03.589 --> 00:03:05.489
Yes. I'm fine.


00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:08.124
All right.


00:03:08.995 --> 00:03:10.586
Take care.


00:03:17.568 --> 00:03:18.695
Okay.


00:03:24.242 --> 00:03:27.142
WNPC, New Jersey.


00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:31.442
Hey, you kids out there on joyrides,
