to a nonstop weekend Spaz-a-thon,


00:03:41.758 --> 00:03:44.784
with me, the Super Spaz.


00:03:44.861 --> 00:03:50.526
No sleep, no breaks,
just me and you, my little rodents.


00:03:50.599 --> 00:03:53.693
