00:15:19.182 --> 00:15:20.740
Can you hear me?


00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:22.710
What?


00:15:23.852 --> 00:15:24.841
What?


00:15:26.456 --> 00:15:30.950
Yes? Yes? You can hear me?


00:15:38.934 --> 00:15:41.093
I'm going to help you, okay?


00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:50.636
