Can you leave it overnight?


00:25:40.165 --> 00:25:42.794
No, no, overnight, that doesn't work.


00:25:44.136 --> 00:25:49.096
Well, there's a garage over on First Street.
You could try them.


00:25:49.174 --> 00:25:51.972
They're not gonna tell you
nothing new, though.


00:25:55.347 --> 00:25:58.281
