00:26:48.130 --> 00:26:51.656
Right, Mom, I know. Okay.
I'll drop everything. I'm going, okay?


00:26:52.700 --> 00:26:54.258
Mary, you sure you're okay?


00:26:57.038 --> 00:26:58.129
Yeah.


00:26:59.407 --> 00:27:00.703
Sorry, it's just...


00:27:01.542 --> 00:27:02.940
