00:27:04.579 --> 00:27:06.945
All right, sweetheart, I love you.


00:27:07.681 --> 00:27:08.807
Love you, too.


00:27:09.617 --> 00:27:10.605
Fuck.


00:27:12.485 --> 00:27:14.420
Five more minutes


00:27:14.488 --> 00:27:18.150
