to the tweet-tweet orphanage.


00:27:24.563 --> 00:27:26.758
Nice talking to you, too!


00:27:27.833 --> 00:27:30.563
Come on, come on, come on.


00:27:31.171 --> 00:27:34.571
- Sorry, my nerves are just a little raw.
- Okay, sugar.


00:27:38.877 --> 00:27:40.971
Fuck. Come on.


00:28:08.539 --> 00:28:11.098
What's the best way to cover a small dent?


00:28:12.710 --> 00:28:16.009
