Cover the first collision?


00:28:53.280 --> 00:28:55.181
Okay, Mary,


00:28:57.419 --> 00:28:59.045
you're losing it.


00:29:00.220 --> 00:29:03.121
You're losing it, okay?


00:29:05.893 --> 00:29:08.224
You're losing it, okay? Just...


00:29:08.294 --> 00:29:13.357
Fuck. Okay, just...


00:29:15.135 --> 00:29:19.435
Stop, Mary, just think. Think, okay? Okay?


