the Colombo Elementary County School.


00:30:55.829 --> 00:30:58.195
...little lamb, little lamb


00:30:58.264 --> 00:31:03.635
Mary had a little lamb
its fleece was white as snow


00:31:03.804 --> 00:31:06.705
And everywhere that Mary went...


00:31:41.605 --> 00:31:46.133
Hey, where you been, man?
You've been raging since last night, huh?


00:31:46.210 --> 00:31:48.007
