- Enough, all right? It's not funny anymore.


00:32:49.936 --> 00:32:51.871
The schoolteacher, the...


00:32:51.939 --> 00:32:53.064
What are you talking about?


00:32:53.139 --> 00:32:56.041
The fucking... The schoolteacher!
