00:33:11.924 --> 00:33:13.653
- Huh?
- Yes, I...


00:33:15.729 --> 00:33:17.195
I killed him.


00:33:19.331 --> 00:33:22.630
Okay. Okay, cut it out, all right?
You know...


00:33:23.035 --> 00:33:25.128
What's the matter with you?
That's not funny.


00:33:25.204 --> 00:33:26.864
I'm not... He was...


00:33:27.839 --> 00:33:29.773
He was in the garage


00:33:30.541 --> 00:33:33.907
and stuck to the car, and I hit him and I...


00:33:39.017 --> 00:33:40.677
