00:34:08.478 --> 00:34:10.172
That's some heavy shit, Mary.


00:34:11.947 --> 00:34:13.414
I killed him.


00:34:14.550 --> 00:34:17.382
All right, just... Just...


00:34:17.452 --> 00:34:20.388
- I killed him.
