- I killed him!


00:34:29.029 --> 00:34:30.463
- I know, I know.
- I killed him.


00:34:30.532 --> 00:34:33.591
- I didn't mean it. I didn't mean it.
- I know. Okay, it's okay, it's okay, it's okay.


00:34:37.705 --> 00:34:39.036
I just...


00:34:41.910 --> 00:34:44.809
I told him I was gonna help him,
and then he just...


00:34:45.344 --> 00:34:48.677
He started attacking me, so I just...
I hit him with a golf club.


00:34:51.385 --> 00:34:53.478
You hit him with a golf club?


00:34:54.519 --> 00:34:57.284
Oh, my God. You're fucking nuts.


00:34:57.356 --> 00:34:58.550
Don't yell at me.


00:34:58.624 --> 00:35:01.855
I'm not yelling at you,
but I need to know what happened.


00:35:01.928 --> 00:35:03.589
All right, Mary? You want to know why?


00:35:04.329 --> 00:35:05.763
'Cause you're gonna need my help.


00:35:06.364 --> 00:35:07.730
Trust me on that.


00:35:08.533 --> 00:35:09.522
I just...


00:35:12.004 --> 00:35:13.561
I just panicked.


00:35:15.207 --> 00:35:18.006
He was just lying on the bumper like some


00:35:18.944 --> 00:35:20.911
