00:35:20.978 --> 00:35:22.776
and he was just screaming at me,
and he just...


00:35:22.847 --> 00:35:26.715
He started to, like, attack me,
and he just wouldn't stop, and so,


00:35:26.784 --> 00:35:29.777
I just grabbed the first thing I saw
and it was a golf club,


00:35:29.854 --> 00:35:30.912
and I didn't mean it. I didn't mean it.


00:35:30.988 --> 00:35:33.957
You have to believe me.
I did not mean it. I didn't mean it.


00:35:34.024 --> 00:35:37.084
Mary, of course I believe you.


00:35:37.160 --> 00:35:40.391
Okay? How long have we been going out?
Two years, right?


00:35:41.031 --> 00:35:44.557
I believe every word
that comes out of your mouth, okay?


00:35:45.568 --> 00:35:46.627
Okay?


00:35:49.305 --> 00:35:52.468
