- One that works.


00:36:46.526 --> 00:36:49.825
Okay? One that we've gotta stick to,
and it's gotta be rock solid.


00:36:50.830 --> 00:36:52.661
Okay, but what do we do?


00:36:53.600 --> 00:36:54.861
Okay, okay.


00:36:58.104 --> 00:37:02.904
No one, nowhere, no how,
can know about this, okay?


00:37:03.575 --> 00:37:06.772
I know you want to vent right now,
but the most important thing you can do


00:37:06.845 --> 00:37:09.781
- is keep your mouth shut.
- I don't think I can.


00:37:09.849 --> 00:37:13.249
And then we move on one day at a time.


00:37:13.318 --> 00:37:15.445
No mouthing off,
no loose ends, no haircuts,


00:37:15.520 --> 00:37:19.718
nothing that brings attention to yourself,
Mary, and I mean nothing.


00:37:23.994 --> 00:37:27.829
This will pass, okay? I promise.


00:37:27.899 --> 00:37:31.391
This guy will get his 15 minutes of fame
and then bam, he ain't shit no more.


00:37:31.469 --> 00:37:33.493
They'll find someone else to talk about.


00:37:35.339 --> 00:37:36.930
That's the plan.


00:37:37.674 --> 00:37:39.163
You on board?


00:37:42.144 --> 00:37:43.736
Okay, come here.


00:37:51.153 --> 00:37:53.985
You feeling better now? Huh?


00:37:59.895 --> 00:38:02.763
Come on. Come on.


00:38:05.633 --> 00:38:06.794
What?


00:38:06.868 --> 00:38:08.129
