00:38:55.714 --> 00:38:56.840
Rick?


00:39:02.322 --> 00:39:03.309
Rick?


00:39:06.757 --> 00:39:07.849
Rick?


00:39:09.227 --> 00:39:10.317
Rick?


00:39:38.921 --> 00:39:40.583
Fucking jerk, you're lucky
I didn't stab you with this!


00:39:40.657 --> 00:39:41.749
Whoa!


00:39:41.924 --> 00:39:43.324
Whoa! Easy there, girl.


00:39:44.026 --> 00:39:45.392
