00:39:47.530 --> 00:39:48.757
Come on.


00:39:56.805 --> 00:40:01.673
Hey, little fucker, what's up? Huh?


00:40:02.010 --> 00:40:03.944
Hey... Jesus!


00:40:04.813 --> 00:40:06.906
Little bitch.


00:40:16.858 --> 00:40:18.188
I'm sorry.


00:40:20.995 --> 00:40:23.792
Just relax, all right?


00:40:23.864 --> 00:40:28.665
Take some of your dad's meds,
