00:40:38.178 --> 00:40:40.168
You know, I can't think straight.


00:40:40.747 --> 00:40:42.647
I gotta get some sleep.


00:40:43.448 --> 00:40:45.882
So do you, okay?


00:41:20.017 --> 00:41:21.177
Hello?


00:41:23.620 --> 00:41:24.813
Hello?


00:41:27.423 --> 00:41:28.549
Rick?


00:42:18.839 --> 00:42:21.000
- Mary?
- Rick, I'm scared.


00:42:22.776 --> 00:42:27.735
- It's 3:30 in the fucking morning.
