Sit around and worry?


00:42:54.306 --> 00:42:57.206
Trust me,
it's only gonna make things worse.


00:42:59.477 --> 00:43:02.412
Listen, Mary, all right? I'm counting on you.


00:43:03.247 --> 00:43:05.511
You need to calm yourself down.
All right, sweetie?


00:43:05.583 --> 00:43:07.641
